#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:6
msgid "Create your Reviewbird account"
msgstr "Reviewbird 계정 만들기"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:7
msgid "Start with the free plan, then connect your WooCommerce store whenever you are ready."
msgstr "무료 플랜으로 시작한 후 준비가 되면 WooCommerce 스토어를 연결하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:14
msgid "Authorize your WooCommerce store"
msgstr "WooCommerce 스토어 승인"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:15
msgid "Connect Reviewbird so it can securely sync products, orders, and review activity."
msgstr "제품, 주문 및 리뷰 활동을 안전하게 동기화할 수 있도록 Reviewbird를 연결하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:22
msgid "Turn on your review experience"
msgstr "리뷰 경험 활성화"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:23
msgid "Enable the widget in WordPress and start collecting polished, conversion-friendly product reviews."
msgstr "WordPress에서 위젯을 활성화하고 세련되고 전환 친화적인 제품 리뷰 수집을 시작하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:53
msgid "Step"
msgstr "단계"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:82
msgid "Welcome to Reviewbird for WooCommerce"
msgstr "WooCommerce용 Reviewbird에 오신 것을 환영합니다"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:93
msgid "Collect more reviews with less friction."
msgstr "더 적은 마찰로 더 많은 리뷰를 수집하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:100
msgid "Reviewbird helps WooCommerce merchants collect, moderate, and showcase product reviews with a polished experience that feels native to their storefront."
msgstr "Reviewbird는 WooCommerce 판매자가 매장에 자연스럽게 어울리는 세련된 경험으로 제품 리뷰를 수집, 검토 및 전시할 수 있도록 도와줍니다."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:115
msgid "Get Started Free"
msgstr "무료로 시작하기"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:122
msgid "Free plan available. Create your account first, then connect WooCommerce when you are ready."
msgstr "무료 플랜 이용 가능. 먼저 계정을 만들고 준비가 되면 WooCommerce를 연결하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:129
msgid "Already have an account?"
msgstr "이미 계정이 있나요?"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:136
msgid "Connect your store"
msgstr "스토어 연결"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:145
msgid "See It In Action"
msgstr "실제 사용 모습 보기"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:148
msgid "A quick look at the Reviewbird widget"
msgstr "Reviewbird 위젯을 빠르게 살펴보기"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:154
msgid "Leaving a review shouldn't feel like applying for a loan. Our widget makes review submission easy and painless."
msgstr "리뷰를 남기는 것이 대출 신청처럼 느껴져서는 안 됩니다. 저희 위젯은 리뷰 제출을 쉽고 간편하게 만듭니다."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:165
msgid "Reviewbird onboarding video"
msgstr "Reviewbird 온보딩 비디오"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:182
msgid "Setup"
msgstr "설정"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:185
msgid "Go live in three quick steps."
msgstr "세 단계로 빠르게 시작하세요."

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:188
msgid "Create your account, connect WooCommerce, then"
msgstr "계정을 만들고 WooCommerce를 연결한 다음"

#: assets/src/js/components/WelcomeScreen.jsx:196
msgid "enable the widget in settings"
msgstr "설정에서 위젯을 활성화하세요"
